request rewritten v1 "Parts request"
description "A stage due by a plant's days, five hours behind UTC, and reminded by the head office's days in Tokyo's time, paused in the head office's days (fictional rules). The same request is in `before/` and in `after/`; its calendars in `after/` close days the ones in `before/` keep open, as calendars written again under a ticket in progress do"

use organization org from "../../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar west from "west.cal"
use calendar office from "office.cal"

form
  what : text "What"  count >=1 <=100

route
  decide  manager

who
  manager = manager of requester

every stage
  due in 3 business days in west at 12:00
  remind after 1 business day in office at 09:00
  when late escalate, then expire
  when empty escalate, then skip

ticket
  self approval  not allowed
  pause          at most 2 business days in office
